WEBVTT

00:02:37.236 --> 00:02:38.738
(Music ends)

00:02:41.365 --> 00:02:42.533
Thank you.

00:02:42.575 --> 00:02:43.743
(Applause)

00:02:43.784 --> 00:02:45.745
I can't speak Spanish, by the way, so.

00:02:47.496 --> 00:02:50.499
Teaching an AI the sonic
properties of one sound

00:02:50.541 --> 00:02:52.752
in order to generate an entirely new sound

00:02:52.793 --> 00:02:54.921
is what I like to call "spawning."

00:02:55.588 --> 00:02:59.508
Spawning is what allows Holly+
to create a wide range of vocals

00:02:59.508 --> 00:03:00.885
that I didn't sing